      "match": {
        "status": "matched",
        "via": "override",
        "reason": "DFO salmon: the Smith Inlet Long Lake (GNIS 31514, 2134 ha), confirmed by the Docee River (blk 360877652) which touches it at 0.0 m and is the next water in the same DFO section. Region 5 has FIVE gazetted Long Lakes (gnis 17503/17508/17509/17513/31514), one per MU, so name+region does NOT identify this water for the PROVINCE — which is exactly why this entry is tagged source=dfo. DFO region 5 names only one Long Lake.",
